cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "EAI: ADNI to FHIR via LLM-Powered ETL"
abstract: >-
  An Extract, AI-Process, Integrate (EAI) pipeline that transforms the ADNI
  dataset into HL7 FHIR R4 resources using a locally-deployed Llama 3.1 (8B)
  model. Three stages: terminology mapping (LOINC/SNOMED via OntoServer),
  agentic JSONata generation (ReAct loop), and deterministic full-dataset
  transform.
keywords:
  - FHIR
  - ADNI
  - LLM
  - ETL
  - JSONata
  - Llama 3.1
  - Ontoserver
  - precision medicine
  - Alzheimer's disease
license: MIT
